  "boundaries": [
    "The runtime requires a measured explicit undefined-flags profile and never derives one from the executing host. ProductSignParity clears ZF; ProductSignParityZero derives ZF from the low product. Both derive SF/PF from the low product and clear AF.",
    "The independent original host probe observes 2,700 matching cases on each core; exchanging P/E profiles produces 748 differences on each core. Native protected tests also exercise truncated/immediate products.",
    "The source is read without write permission before any result or flag publication. Full products use AX, DX:AX or EDX:EAX; truncated IMUL writes only the selected register. CF/OF follow architectural representability.",
    "LA57 is unavailable on the recorded CPU. The remaining unlisted legacy scalars, general i386 exporter, real/VM86, tasks/call gates, debug producers, software SMM/enclave/AEX/EPCM and complete CET/FRED/event domains are not certified.",
    "This software-executor change needs no new LLVM/NeverC builtin. The global completion and final SDK release/pin gates remain open."
  ],
